,"kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","content":"aborted pre-prompt 已按正确顺序触发；剩余断言忽略了 compaction 的 retained tail。Pi 语义是摘要旧前缀、保留最近完整用户/assistant 尾部，因此下一请求上下文应为 summary + aborted turn + 新 prompt。我会修正 oracle 断言，不删除该尾部。","startedSeq":71434,"endedSeq":71506,"startedAt":"1788485559Z","endedAt":"1788485560Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8267,"revision":71506,"observedAt":"1788485560Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788477293Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788485560Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788477293,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788485560,"revision":71506,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","messageId":"msg_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1fb67f8487d0908400020b922b40","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"_meta":{"codex":{"phase":"commentary"},"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-71507","seq":71507,"timestamp":"1788485563Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":71507,"endedSeq":71658,"startedAt":"1788485563Z","endedAt":"1788485584Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":71507,"activityEndSeq":71658,"totalEventCount":4,"toolCallCount":2,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-msg_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1fd0a8e887d0bed1a3020bccec5c","seq":71761,"timestamp":"1788485584Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","content":"核心 lifecycle 回归现在全绿：session-api、agent-core、host-core 均通过。接下来我会并行审查两条尚未闭合的验收面，但不启用新的子代理：一是 SessionRepository/HostStore TCK 的现有覆盖与当前门禁脚本；二是生产 Host 组合入口是否仍绕过 profiles/credentials/resources/telemetry/artifact/export。先用代码证据划定最小集成范围，再继续修改。","startedSeq":71659,"endedSeq":71761,"startedAt":"1788485584Z","endedAt":"1788485586Z","timing":{"sessionElap